なんだかどうして 未来になんぞ
Somehow feeling like there's nothing to be looking forward to.

289
00:23:51,321 --> 00:23:54,121
何の希望もない 期待できないような気がして もう随分生きている
No hope to find, cannot be defined, that's how I'm feeling inside.

290
00:23:55,151 --> 00:23:57,241
既視感とテンプレで食傷 素敵な出来事の気配もない
There's nothing left to view, lived long enough, nothing is new.

291
00:24:00,131 --> 00:24:01,421
残念 積んだ経験の因果 形骸化された神話と退屈な進化
Saddening, too much knowledge results in feeling like every myth is but another boring evolution.

292
00:24:04,151 --> 00:24:05,151
要は刺激が欲しいんだ 飽きちゃった 慣れちゃった
Thrill is what I really want now, bored and down, used to frowns.

293
00:24:08,101 --> 00:24:08,821
なんて 整っていくガイダンス 増えるコンプライアンス
And this is the way the guidance grew, rising compliance too.

294
00:24:11,131 --> 00:24:12,831
蓋されていくみたい 吸い尽くして
It's like I'm going under a lid, I consumed everything.

295
00:24:13,961 --> 00:24:16,081
あれもこれもどれも 同じ味がする
This one or that one or, whichever, and now it all just tastes the same.

296
00:24:19,061 --> 00:24:19,541
Undead 死んじない
Undead, still alive!

297
00:24:20,741 --> 00:24:23,051
お前とお前の連鎖
Time is a chain of your own path.

298
00:24:23,801 --> 00:24:27,841
いつの世も 過去も未来も 今にあるんだ
