00:24:48,381 --> 00:24:49,081
Unhappy? 悩める人の子よ
Unhappy? If you're dealing with a lotta woes.

307
00:24:49,741 --> 00:24:51,351
Unlucky? 人ならざるものも
Unlucky? Then you gotta listen very close.

308
00:24:51,351 --> 00:24:53,351
Be happy! 絶えず目指せよ
Be happy! Keep on trying, never give up.

309
00:24:53,351 --> 00:24:54,941
生きているんだろう
Be aware that you're alive.

310
00:24:54,941 --> 00:24:57,701
不幸に浸るも 幸せになるのも
